Package: phix
Type: Package
Title: Interactive EXIF GPS and Date Editor for Scanned Photos
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("George", "Ostrouchov", email = "gostrouc@utk.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: A Shiny application for adding or correcting GPS location and
    creation-date metadata in digitized or scanned photos (film prints,
    slides, negatives). Provides interactive map-based location selection,
    batch editing via clipboard, and direct EXIF writes powered by ExifTool.
    Utility functions for reading and writing photo metadata are also exported
    for programmatic use.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
SystemRequirements: ExifTool (https://exiftool.org)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
    shiny,
    bslib,
    leaflet,
    exiftoolr,
    magick,
    DT,
    httr,
    jsonlite,
    lutz,
    stats,
    tools
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
